# 8. CLIENT FINANCE MODULE FRAMEWORK

Create a reusable integration framework so future Nex Veins products can use the finance engine without duplicating accounting logic.

## 8.1 Finance API

Expose versioned APIs for supported operations, including:

- Create or update permitted master records.
- Create and issue invoices.
- Record receipts and payments.
- Record expenses and vendor bills.
- Submit transactions for approval.
